      "message": "My suggestion:\n\n- Add `get_gki_modules_list` function\n- Announce removal of `COMMON_GKI_MODULES_LIST` on GKI newsletter\n- After a few weeks, delete `COMMON_GKI_MODULES_LIST` from mainline and android15\n- Start adding arch specific modules",
