      "writtenOn": "2023-08-02T18:05:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "If `COMMON_GKI_MODULES_LIST` is being consumed by partners; is it a good idea to make it as an internal; and expose `{ARCH}_GKI_MODULES_LIST` as a public interface?\n\nIn `modules.bzl`:\n\n```\nAARCH64_GKI_MODULES_LIST \u003d COMMON_GKI_MODULES_LIST + \n[\n    # keep sorted\n]\n```",
